--- DESCRIPTION ---
How Beethoven's Symphony No. 1 opens in the wrong key, builds sonata form across the Allegro con brio, and how to write exam-quality sentences about it.

--- CONTENT_HTML ---
<figure class="sv-annotated-player sv-ap-wave" data-lesson-id="15f1102d-693f-40bd-bb20-04098929506f" data-audio="https://pub-f7b76d81365b4b2f954567763694a24e.r2.dev/music-aqa/western-classical-1650-1910/lesson-01.mp3" data-peaks="https://pub-f7b76d81365b4b2f954567763694a24e.r2.dev/music-aqa/western-classical-1650-1910/lesson-01.peaks.json"><div class="sv-ap-bar"><button type="button" class="sv-ap-play">&#9654;</button><span class="sv-ap-tick">0:00 / 9:41</span><span class="sv-ap-now">Press a pin, or a number in the text</span></div><div class="sv-ap-wrap"><canvas class="sv-ap-canvas"></canvas><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c1" data-t="0" style="left:0.00%">1<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>1 &middot; Adagio molto introduction</strong>Dominant seventh &mdash; an opening chord that pulls towards F major: the wrong key, on purpose.</span></button><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c2" data-t="107" style="left:18.40%">2<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>2 &middot; Allegro con brio</strong>Sforzando &mdash; sudden forced accents &mdash; and a fast <dfn class="term" data-def="Gradually getting louder.">crescendo</dfn> as C major finally lands.</span></button><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c3" data-t="143" style="left:24.59%">3<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>3 &middot; Second subject</strong>Second subject &mdash; the contrasting melody in a related key, carried by the wind.</span></button><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c4" data-t="232.5" style="left:39.99%">4<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>4 &middot; Exposition repeat</strong>Exposition &mdash; the section presenting both subjects; Classical convention repeats it in full.</span></button><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c5" data-t="378" style="left:65.00%">5<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>5 &middot; Development</strong>Development &mdash; fragments of the themes pushed through unstable, shifting keys.</span></button><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c6" data-t="406" style="left:69.82%">6<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>6 &middot; Recapitulation</strong>Recapitulation &mdash; the themes return, now settled in the home key of C major.</span></button><button type="button" class="sv-ap-pin" data-cid="c7" data-t="520" style="left:89.42%">7<span class="sv-ap-tip"><strong>7 &middot; Coda</strong>Coda &mdash; the closing passage: emphatic <dfn class="term" data-def="Chord patterns that end a phrase, like musical punctuation.">cadences</dfn> hammering the ending home.</span></button></div><script type="application/json" class="sv-ap-peaks">{"duration":581.5,"peaks":[0.01,0.012,0.012,0.308,0.328,0.208,0.159,0.179,0.116,0.024,0.026,0.016,0.303,0.344,0.234,0.167,0.163,0.13,0.033,0.012,0.012,0.13,0.165,0.153,0.222,0.216,0.265,0.277,0.277,0.389,0.438,0.601,0.446,0.112,0.037,0.037,0.057,0.039,0.053,0.157,0.165,0.147,0.139,0.212,0.187,0.198,0.238,0.191,0.208,0.208,0.306,0.316,0.22,0.285,0.275,0.267,0.261,0.246,0.187,0.236,0.22,0.293,0.255,0.34,0.35,0.328,0.352,0.399,0.411,0.417,0.344,0.31,0.53,0.631,0.473,0.167,0.204,0.361,0.379,0.346,0.34,0.365,0.466,0.595,0.442,0.428,0.501,0.534,0.446,0.291,0.297,0.613,0.591,0.422,0.574,0.336,0.269,0.253,0.279,0.314,0.206,0.287,0.198,0.185,0.208,0.206,0.236,0.285,0.234,0.222,0.167,0.171,0.092,0.108,0.081,0.112,0.077,0.11,0.151,0.269,0.265,0.108,0.077,0.09,0.11,0.061,0.244,0.346,0.413,0.564,0.34,0.128,0.42,0.318,0.151,0.525,0.483,0.851,0.815,0.682,0.892,0.554,0.403,0.515,0.434,0.458,0.53,0.886,0.346,0.493,0.413,0.472,0.55,0.811,0.314,0.456,0.456,0.397,0.434,0.464,0.627,0.764,0.684,0.582,0.654,0.64,0.527,0.58,0.686,0.786,0.556,0.338,0.114,0.114,0.181,0.12,0.1,0.151,0.177,0.354,0.218,0.324,0.228,0.167,0.171,0.175,0.218,0.128,0.151,0.155,0.155,0.139,0.275,0.242,0.403,0.267,0.285,0.587,0.509,0.532,0.395,0.601,0.568,0.32,0.525,0.385,0.314,0.418,0.564,0.503,0.617,0.128,0.124,0.141,0.163,0.269,0.265,0.167,0.216,0.216,0.212,0.204,0.173,0.143,0.326,0.32,0.365,0.475,0.654,0.55